ext-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nYou're now ready to start creating your first NFT! Here are some recommended next steps:\r\n\r\n1. Learn more about how you can use these programs on [Metaplex](https://developers.metaplex.com) official documentation.\r\n2. Explore the [Challenges section](/en/challenges) for hands-on exercises\r\n3. Join our community to share your ideas, implementations and get help\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}